"text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Root Cause Analysis"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Risk Management"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Safety Management Systems"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Human Factors"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Technical Writing"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Excel + Power BI"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Aviation Quality Software"},{"type":"p","text":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"Data Analytics"}]},{"heading":"Target Profile by Graduation","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"p","text":"By the end of the AME/aviation training pathway, the student should ideally have:"},{"type":"list","items":[{"text":"Strong aircraft maintenance fundamentals"},{"text":"Understanding of aircraft systems"},{"text":"Strong aviation regulatory awareness"},{"text":"Knowledge of DGCA requirements"},{"text":"Maintenance documentation skills"},{"text":"Quality assurance fundamentals"},{"text":"Audit methodology"},{"text":"CAPA knowledge"},{"text":"Root Cause Analysis"},{"text":"Risk assessment"},{"text":"Safety Management Systems knowledge"},{"text":"Human factors awareness"},{"text":"Advanced Excel"},{"text":"Basic Power BI"},{"text":"Strong technical writing"},{"text":"At least one aviation quality project"},{"text":"Practical exposure to an airline/MRO environment"},{"text":"Understanding of technical records and compliance monitoring"}]},{"type":"h","text":"Best Overall Positioning"},{"type":"p","text":"The strongest positioning is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aviation Quality Auditor","Aircraft Maintenance Knowledge","Regulatory Compliance","Safety Management","Quality Systems"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"The student should not position themselves merely as an auditor. The strongest professionals understand the technical maintenance environment they audit."},{"type":"h","text":"Ideal long-term pathway"},{"type":"flow","items":["AME/Aviation Maintenance","Maintenance Quality","Quality Auditor","Senior Aviation Auditor","Quality/Compliance Lead","Aviation Quality Manager"]},{"type":"p","text":"A particularly future-ready profile is:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Aircraft Maintenance","DGCA/Regulatory Knowledge","Auditing","SMS","CAPA/RCA","Aviation Data Analytics","Digital QMS."],"sep":"+"}]}]}